### 1. GET all orders (Criteria 1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders

### 2. POST valid order (Criteria 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Almaz",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 24000,
  "dishes": [{"name": "Doro Wat", "priceSantim": 24000}],
  "phone": "+251911223344"
}

### 3. POST with negative number (Criteria 2 - Should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Almaz",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": -5,
  "dishes": []
}

### 4. POST with extra field (Criteria 3 - Should be stripped)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Almaz",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 5000,
  "dishes": [{"name": "Shiro", "priceSantim": 5000}],
  "isAdmin": true
}